      "description": "Playing Sandstone Bridge now uses the ETB +1/+1 bonus on Mesa Unicorn for just 1 extra damage/life this turn. Saving Sandstone Bridge for later (e.g., when Emiel the Blessed or another more impactful creature is in play) could provide more value from the ETB trigger. The temporary +1/+1 on a 2/2 lifelinker against a nearly empty board is low-impact.",
